{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22153","headline":"适意二首 一 · 白居易","name":"适意二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"十年爲旅客，常有饥寒愁。\n三年作谏官，复多尸素羞。\n有酒不暇饮，有山不得游。\n岂无平生志，拘牵不自由。\n一朝归渭上，泛如不系舟。\n置心世事外，无喜亦无忧。\n终日一蔬食，终年一布裘。\n寒来弥嬾放，数日一梳头。\n朝睡足始起，夜酌醉即休。\n人心不过适，适外复何求。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22153.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22153","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}